# Disc images and anything extracted from them. Never commit game data.
*.bin
*.cue
*.img
*.iso
*.nds
*.raw
HBD1PS1D.*
SLPM_*
SLUS*
SYSTEM.CNF

# Decoded corpora and bulk dumps
*.corpus
*.dump
corpus/
dumps/

# Working material from the translation side, which is a SEPARATE and PRIVATE
# repository. None of it may ever land here. Listed by the shapes that workflow
# actually produces rather than by category, because a category is easy to argue
# with at the moment of a `git add .`:
#   pickled reference populations and site tables
#   side-by-side and extract listings, which are decoded script
#   authored English, glossaries, voice sheets, editorial notes
#   emulator save states and RAM captures
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.sav
*.srm
*.state
scratch/
editorial/
*-side-by-side.*
*-extract.*
MANIFEST.sha256

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
build/

# docs/ is ignored wholesale. Three deliberate exceptions and no others:
#   docs/images/*.png  the published screenshots, the only binary assets here
#   docs/CODEX.md      the method rules, referenced by README.md and FORMAT.md
#   docs/FONTS.md      fonts and text rendering, referenced by FORMAT.md
# Phase reports are NOT published from this repo and must not be added here.
docs/*
!docs/images/
docs/images/*
!docs/images/*.png
!docs/CODEX.md
!docs/FONTS.md
